For each \(i=2,\dots,10\), triangle \(A_i A_1 A_{i+1}\) has sides \(x_i\) and \(x_{i+1}\) from \(A_1\), and the included angle \(\theta\) with \(\cos\theta = 12/13\), \(\sin\theta = 5/13\).  

