\(S_3 = \) sum triple products: \(18\cdot72\cdot98 + 18\cdot72\cdot k + 18\cdot98\cdot k + 72\cdot98\cdot k\)  
= \(18\cdot72\cdot98 = 127008\)? Let's compute: 18*72=1296, *98 = 1296*100 - 1296*2 = 129600 - 2592 = 127008.  
